# Accepted vulnerabilities for the container image scan in CI.
#
# One CVE (or CVE with a package qualifier) per line, `#` comments allowed.
# Keep this list empty unless an exception is justified and reviewed:
# a scanner that is permanently red gets ignored, while a short, explicit
# exception list with a reason keeps the gate useful.
#
# When adding an entry, put the reason next to it and remove it once a fixed
# version ships in the base image or the dependency:
#
#   CVE-2024-12345  # curl in alpine:3.21, no fix available; only used by ...
